It replaces the dzVents script "RainStats V2.6", whose idea it follows: statistics
of the rain over 24 h, 48 h, 168 h, 14 d, 30 d, 90 d, 180 d and 365 d, and a
state file that the plugin can import once (RS_LEGACY_FILE). The code is written
anew in Python for Domoticz (standard library only); no part of the script is
copied.

The rain data come from your own Domoticz. The plugin has no data source of its
own and uses no third-party service.
